    "description": "*** OPEN HOUSE: TUESDAY, AUGUST 25 - 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM ***\nDrop in anytime during the window. No appointment needed.\n2805 22nd St (at Florida St), San Francisco\nRarely available and on the rental market for the first time in 40 years - a fully remodeled top-floor Victorian apartment in the heart of the Mission District. Approximately 1,400 sq ft, blending original 1910 character with a complete 2026 renovation.\nTHE HOME\n- 3 spacious bedrooms\n- Full bath plus a separate toilet room\n- Two grand formal rooms (living and dining), each with an original Victorian fireplace, bay windows, and built-in china cabinets\n- Restored original oak and parquet floors, high ceilings, wainscoting and crown molding\n- Remodeled kitchen: quartz-style counters and backsplash, stainless refrigerator, gas range, generous cabinetry\n- Updated bath: marble-style tile, glass-enclosed shower, modern black fixtures\n- In-unit laundry, central heat and A/C, smart doorbell\n- Shared greenhouse bonus space\n- Sweeping downtown San Francisco skyline views from the top floor\nTERMS\nRent: $7,350/month\nSecurity deposit: $7,350\nLease: 12 months minimum, longer terms available\nAvailable: immediately\nIncluded in rent: water and trash\nTenant pays: PG&E (gas and electric), internet, cable\nParking: street parking only\nSmoking: not permitted\nPets: considered, $250 pet deposit\nLocated steps from the restaurants and shops along 22nd Street, with convenient access to transit.\nFull photo gallery and details: missionvictorian.com\nSerious inquiries only.",
