    "description": "Spacious 1,425 sq ft stand-alone home in the heart of the Mission. Three bedrooms and two full baths, plus two separate rooms that work well as home offices or guest space. This is a quiet and peaceful retreat as the home is a standalone residence set behind the front Victorian and off street level. \n\nWhat's included:\n- 3 bedrooms, 2 full bathrooms\n- 2 additional rooms ideal for offices or studio space\n- In-unit washer and dryer\n- All utilities included (garbage, water, electric)\n- Dishwasher, gas stove w/ strong vent fan\n- Shared outdoor courtyard and grill\n- Hallway storage closet\n- Pet friendly\n- Street parking easily available\n\nThe location puts you a short walk from the restaurants and cafes along Valencia and 24th Street, with BART at both 16th St and 24th St Mission for an easy ride downtown, and quick access to 101 and 280. Dolores Park and the 24th Street farmers market are both close by.\nIf interested, please reply with your best contact number.",
